llow-up so you can focus on the content.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="border-b border-border"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 md:px-8 md:py-24 lg:py-32"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8 max-w-3xl mb-12 lg:mb-16"><p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[var(--accent-coral)]">Who this is for</p><h2 class="mt-4 text-balance font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-foreground">Creators whose content connects with products.</h2><p class="mt-5 text-pretty leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground lg:text-base">Reachzy is built around creators whose content naturally connects with products, tools, and brands. If your audience watches you build, review, or demonstrate software and tools, there's likely a fit.</p></div><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8"><div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3"><div class="transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-8"><div class="bg-card border border-border rounded-xl p-6 md:p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-primary/40 hover:shadow-[0_6px_24px_rgba(0,0,0,0.25)] hover:-translate-y-[1px] p-6"><div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center size-12 rounded-lg bg-primary/10 text-primary mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-laptop size-6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 5a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v8.526a2 2 0 0 0 .212.897l1.068 2.127a1 1 0 0 1-.9 1.45H3.62a1 1 0 0 1-.9-1.45l1.068-2.127A2 2 0 0 0 4 15.526V7a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z"></path><path d="M20.054 15.987H3.946"></path></svg></div><h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-medium text-foreground mb-2">Tech creators</h3><p class="text-pretty text-muted-foreground">Reviews, comparisons, and coverage of hardware or software products.</p